  // Patterns that could match a leading dot:
  // - .* (explicit dot) - but * alone doesn't match leading dot
  // - \. (escaped dot)
  // - Character classes that include dot 
  // But NOT:
  // - * (wildcard) alone
  // - ? (single char wildcard) alone
  // - Character classes that don't explicitly allow dot

